  unitName: Terra Broadsword Duran
  unitId: 30635
  unitNumber: 1046
  description: Wielder of the Sacred Blade. Deeming Duran's immense power as unsuitable
    for a mere mortal to handle, the gods not only sought to take the Sacred Blade
    from him, but also to punish the goddess who had granted it to him. Duran instead
    used the sword to protect the goddess as an act of appreciation towards her,
    slaying demon after demon in her name. However, fearing this power of his that
    transcended that of the gods themselves, he decided to seal it away with a strong
    warning so that future generations could not use it for evil purposes.
  summonDesc: A power that drives the ego mad.<br>Only those who can control it<br>can
    use the Sacred Treasures.
  fusionDesc: Don't think this technique can give<br>you true power. That misunderstanding<br>could
    make you very unhappy.
  evoDesc: When we gain power, our relationships<br>with others change. Can you keep<br>being
    yourself? We'll have to see.
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
